{"id":"nid","lemma":"nid","pos":"noun","rank":2857,"glosses":["nest","Some people or dangerous things, hidden or not"],"ipa":"/ni/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/54/Fr-nid.ogg/Fr-nid.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"nids"},"formAudio":{"nids":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-nids.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Les oiseaux construisent des nids.","en":"Birds build nests.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/45346","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"bird","l":"oiseau"},{"g":"to build","l":"construire"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Petit à petit, l'oiseau fait son nid.","en":"Little by little, the bird made his nest.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"bird"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"little by little"]]},{"text":"Les oiseaux font leurs nids dans les arbres.","en":"Birds make their nests in trees.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"bird","l":"oiseau"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"them","l":"leur"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"tree","l":"arbre"}]},{"text":"Tous les oiseaux ne construisent pas de nids.","en":"Not all birds build nests.","words":[{"g":"all"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"bird","l":"oiseau"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to build","l":"construire"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"En voiture, faites attention aux nid-de-poules.","en":"While driving, mind the potholes.","words":[{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"car"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"attention"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"hen","l":"poule"}]}]}